## Documentation SONIA replay fixture

The cache entry and manifest under
`inst/extdata/sonia/` contain the official monthly
SONIA IADB response for series `IUMASOIA`, covering 31 January 1997 through
31 December 2025. They are bundled solely to make the documented public-reader
and chart workflow deterministic and offline. The manifest records the exact
canonical request, retrieval time, byte count, and SHA-256 response hash.
These files are Bank of England Database data, not MIT-licensed package code,
and carry the SONIA attribution below.

